  "title": "Trex Selects Fencing Supply Group As Exclusive National Distributor For Trex Fencing",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va., July 20, 2026 – Trex Company [NYSE:TREX], the world’s largest manufacturer of wood-alternative decking, railing, and fencing and a leading brand of high-performance outdoor living products has signed a multi-year agreement with Fencing Supply Group (FSG) to become the exclusive national distributor of Trex® Fencing.",
